      "content": "About Meridian Retail: \"It's late at night on a holiday weekend, and the on-call team is down to one person who is already handling other tickets. Escalating this to high severity would force an unnecessary wake-up call for the senior engineering staff, which we want to avoid.\""
    },
    {
